# Summary

The charter states that each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter [[cite:obs-ce3554fe8da52980a6fef73305e8f2beb32b4fc4 "Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter."]].

According to the annex, the ordinary contribution is one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January [[cite:obs-7f94c10d8ecec8ba0062ff04b67bdceccdebf36b "Ordinary contributions: one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January."]].
